ese odometer readings to determine if any reported reading is less than a previous odometer reading.<BR> <BR>     <BR> <P> IMPORTANT! Carfax has found important information in its database that should be considered when purchasing this 1987 Pontiac Fiero SE.<P>    <P>Vehicle History Analyzed: Results: <BR>Salvage Auction Records   Checked - No Salvage Auction Records Found <BR>Failed Emissions Inspection   Checked - Failed Emissions Inspection Found <BR>Grey Market Vehicle   Checked - No Grey Market History Found <BR>Registered for government use   Checked - No Government Use Found <BR>Registered for non-profit use   Checked - No Non-Profit Use Found <BR>Vehicle sold/registered as part of a fleet   Checked - No Fleet History Found <BR>Registered for taxi use   Checked - No Taxi Use Found <BR>Registered for commercial use   Checked - No Commercial Use Found <BR>Registered for rental use   Checked - No Rental Use Found <BR>Registered for lease use   Checked - No Lease Use Found <P><BR>Click here for a complete Carfax Glossary containing terms used within this report.<BR> <BR> <BR>     <BR> <P>The Carfax database contains the following 10 records on this 1987 Pontiac Fiero SE:<P>   <BR> <BR>DATE<BR>REPORTED     ODOMETER<BR>READING     INFORMATION<BR>SOURCE     GENERAL<BR>COMMENTS <BR>11/05/1990     34,928       California<BR>Inspection Station<BR>Los Altos, CA<BR>     Passed emissions inspection <BR> <BR>            <BR>            <BR>            <BR>11/05/1990             California<BR>Inspection Station<BR>Los Altos, CA<BR>     Failed emissions inspection <BR> <BR>            <BR>            <BR>            <BR>12/05/1992     59,380       California<BR>Inspection Station<BR>Los Altos, CA<BR>     Passed emissions inspection <BR> <BR>            <BR>            <BR>            <BR>12/05/1992             California<BR>Inspection Station<BR>Los Altos, CA<BR>     Failed emissions inspection <BR> <BR>            <BR>            <BR>            <BR>11/13/1994     82,065   